  "s": "秒",
  "Ask about voices, rhythm or notation using the selected notes and chat history. Preview highlights proposed changes; Apply saves one undoable edit.": "可根据所选音符及对话记录询问声部、节奏或记谱问题。预览会高亮拟修改的音符，应用后可撤销。",
  "Click a note, Shift-click to add notes, or drag to select a passage. Ctrl/⌘-click or click a bar number selects a measure; Esc clears selection.": "单击选择音符，Shift 单击追加选择，拖动可框选乐段。Ctrl/⌘ 单击或单击小节号可选择整小节；Esc 清除选择。",
  "Click a note, Shift-click to add notes, or drag to select a passage. Ctrl/⌘-click or click a bar number selects a measure; Esc clears selection and preview.": "单击选择音符，Shift 单击追加选择，拖动可框选乐段。Ctrl/⌘ 单击或单击小节号可选择整小节；Esc 清除选择和预览。",
  "Press 1–4 to assign a voice within the staff. Voices 1 and 3 have stems up; 2 and 4 have stems down, with 3 and 4 used for inner lines.": "按 1–4 在当前谱表内分配声部。声部 1、3 的符干向上，2、4 向下；3、4 用于内声部。",
  "Limit each staff to 1–4 simultaneous voices (default: 3). Fewer voices simplify the notation; more preserve independent musical lines.": "每个谱表最多使用 1–4 个声部，默认为 3。较少声部可简化记谱，较多声部可保留独立旋律线。",
  "Reset returns selected notes to the automatic transcription. Delete/Backspace removes notes; Restore brings deleted notes back.": "重置会将所选音符恢复为自动转录结果。Delete/Backspace 删除音符，“恢复”可找回已删除的音符。",
  "Eco uses about a quarter of available cores at background priority; Balanced uses half at low priority; Full uses all cores. Choose Custom to select individual cores.": "节能使用约四分之一核心并设为后台优先级，均衡使用一半核心并设为低优先级，全速使用全部核心。自定义可逐个选择核心。",
  "Lit cores are available to transcription; the fill shows system load. Click to toggle a core and switch to Custom, including during a running transcription.": "亮起的核心可用于转录，填充高度表示系统负载。单击可启用或禁用核心并切换为自定义，对正在运行的转录也立即生效。",
  "Lower priority lets other apps use CPU time first.{0}": "较低优先级会优先为其他应用分配 CPU 时间。{0}",
  "Change playback speed while preserving pitch; Space plays or pauses. Ctrl/⌘ + mouse wheel zooms the pages.": "调节播放速度并保持音高，空格播放或暂停。Ctrl/⌘ + 滚轮缩放页面。",
  "Shift notation and playback by up to an octave; tap the number to reset. Leaving reading mode resets transposition and keeps the speed.": "记谱和播放可上下移调一个八度，单击数字归零。退出阅谱模式后移调归零，速度保留。",
  "Jump to a flagged passage and choose an answer to re-engrave it with an undoable edit. Unsupported choices are disabled.": "跳转到标记的乐段并选择方案，应用后会重新排谱且可撤销。暂不支持的选项不可用。",
  "Edit the title block on page 1 and in PDF/MusicXML exports; an empty title uses the project name. Sizes are relative to normal text (100% ≈ 12 pt).": "编辑第一页及 PDF/MusicXML 导出文件中的标题栏，标题留空时使用项目名称。字号为普通文本的百分比（100% 约为 12 磅）。",
  "Pages scrolls down with pages side by side when space allows; Side-scroll puts them in one horizontal row. Ctrl/⌘ + mouse wheel changes zoom.": "分页模式向下滚动并按可用宽度并排显示页面，横向滚动模式将页面排列为一行。Ctrl/⌘ + 滚轮可缩放。",
  "Space plays or pauses; select a note while stopped to seek. Original audio follows the recording; Score synth plays edited notes with bundled local piano samples and sustained tones for other instruments.": "空格播放或暂停，暂停时选择音符可跳转位置。原始音频遵循录音时间；乐谱合成音播放编辑后的音符，使用本地钢琴采样及其他乐器的持续合成音。",
  "Space: play/pause; R/L: hands; 1–4: voice; ↑/↓: semitone; Shift ↑/↓: octave; Delete: remove; Ctrl/⌘ Z: undo; Ctrl/⌘ Shift Z or Ctrl Y: redo; Esc: clear selection. Shortcuts pause while typing.": "空格：播放/暂停；R/L：左右手；1–4：声部；↑/↓：半音；Shift ↑/↓：八度；Delete：删除；Ctrl/⌘ Z：撤销；Ctrl/⌘ Shift Z 或 Ctrl Y：重做；Esc：清除选择。输入文字时快捷键停用。",
